<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2833"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:jsk@jvlnet.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vdubguy<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vdubguy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, December 27, 2004 - 11:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I was just thinking about a theory of mine that he lurked around in the early morning hours. What was the weather like on each of the murder dates? And the age of the neighborhoods? Lots of fullgrown trees? Lots of shadows? Was the moon full creating more shadows? or a new moon making it even darker?  Just some thoughts...anyone in Wichita able to get old newspapers to see the conditions/moon phase for those dates? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2833-->
<!--Post: 3603--><!--Time: 1105054870-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3603"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lubbock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lubbock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 06, 2005 - 3:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Vdubguy, <BR>On 1/15/74 the moon was in it&#39;s last quarter. It rose - if I&#39;m interpreting the U.S. Naval Observatory Astronomical Applications chart correctly, and if the &#34;Universal Time&#34; they have listed is one and the same with Greenwich time - at 1:04 am Wichita time. <BR> <BR>4/5/74 was a day before a full moon, which rose in the skies above Wichita at 3 in the afternoon. I don&#39;t know when it would&#39;ve set. <BR> <BR>3/17/77 was 2 days before the new moon. 2:33pm on 3/19/77 Wichita. <BR> <BR>12/9/77 was a day before a new moon. 1:33pm on 12/10/77. <BR> <BR>I didn&#39;t print out info for 9/16/86, but I will do so. <BR> <BR>I have more observations along the lines you suggested that I&#39;ll post later. <BR> <BR>Keep in mind that Otero, Bright, and Vain all occured during the day. If you&#39;re suggesting that he watched them the night preceding the murders, could be, but Bright and Vain occured well into the day.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3603-->
<!--Post: 3605--><!--Time: 1105055486-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3605"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lubbock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lubbock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 06, 2005 - 3:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Me again, <BR> <BR>VW &#40;any relation?&#41; was murdered between 10:15 or so and 10:30 at night. Wichita experienced a full moon on 9/17/86 at 11:34pm.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3605-->
<!--Post: 3772--><!--Time: 1105214425-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3772"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:jsk@jvlnet.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vdubguy<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vdubguy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 08, 2005 - 12:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok... thanks ..i guess i was thinking that MAYBE he did his creeping around in the early am hours...since the killings were in the daylihgt hours that kinda makes it unlikely UNLESS he was already in the residences...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
